## Boundary and review

Whole source meshes do not independently validate an arterial junction, branch variant or a continuous branching path. The deep femoral selection includes grouped source components; its two ordered files are one pinned identity, not two separately approved vessels. The lateral circumflex parent is not a separate selectable structure in this set. Course and branching statements describe usual reference anatomy only. This draft does not establish patient registration or clinical completion. Revision-bound radiologist sign-off remains required before an accepted teaching or anatomical claim is made.
